        ":question/math-academy-id": "q-1301",
        ":question/problem": "What is the sum of $\\overset{\\to }{A}=⟨10,5⟩$ and $\\overset{\\to }{B}=⟨8,-2⟩?$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "To compute $\\overset{\\to }{A}+\\overset{\\to }{B},$ we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{A}+\\overset{\\to }{B} & =⟨10,5⟩+⟨8,-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨18,3⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$"
