        ":question/problem": "If $\\overset{\\to }{A}=⟨4,\\frac{1}{2}⟩$, then $-4\\overset{\\to }{A}=$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "To compute $-4\\overset{\\to }{A},$ we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-4\\overset{\\to }{A} & =-4\\cdot ⟨4,\\frac{1}{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(-4)\\cdot 4,(-4)\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-16,-2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$"
